WEBVTT

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.564
And the plots are all the same:

00:05:32.588 --> 00:05:34.459
the soil's the same,

00:05:34.483 --> 00:05:36.192
the precipitation's the same --

00:05:36.216 --> 00:05:38.152
everything's the same.

00:05:38.176 --> 00:05:42.193
Except carbon dioxide
is blown over some of the plots.

00:05:42.637 --> 00:05:45.058
And so you can compare

00:05:45.082 --> 00:05:48.352
what it looks like
under today's conditions

00:05:48.376 --> 00:05:52.563
and under carbon dioxide conditions
later in the century.

00:05:53.032 --> 00:05:56.097
I was part of one of the few studies
that have done this.

00:05:56.121 --> 00:06:00.692
We looked at 18 rice lines
in China and in Japan